Test Cases

1) Public/Private User A to Public User B
    If the button is 'Request'
        Clicked 'Request' changes to 'In Circle'
        Notification is sent to User B

    Else ( button should be 'In Circle' )
        Clicked pop up comes for confirmation
            If confirmed
                'In Circle' changes to 'Request'

2) Public/Private User A to Private User B
    If the button is 'Request'
        Clicked 'Request' changes to 'Requested'
        Notification is sent to User B to either accept or reject
        If User B accepted
            Notification is sent to User A
            For User A 'Requested' changes to 'In Circle'

        Else ( didn't accept )
            'Requested' changes to 'Request'

    Else ( button should be 'In Circle' )
        Clicked pop up comes for confirmation
            If confirmed
                'In Circle' changes to 'Request'

If User A want to remove someone from his circle then 'A' could do it via circle page.